// `std.process`: the home of the process's host interfaces,
// `std.process.Exec.Eff`, which runs a command, and `std.process.Exit.Eff`,
// which exits early. A source names them where it imports this module,
// `import std.process;`, and nowhere else.
//
// The interfaces are native, so no declaration here states them. The
// process's arguments wait for demand.
//
// - see: #4523
